  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Korniszon227/videos?sub_confirmation=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1392449/description_925ade96-1d9b-4f2d-bf86-6b9ffb05f92b.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"70\"></a></em><em><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fAnnoy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1392449/description_36521f72-2fb0-4688-9b79-d8224d709b31.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"70\"></a></em><em><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252fannoy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1392449/description_9a2b8df6-5481-4291-a5e5-3b079c703c3b.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"70\"></a></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><a href=\"https://discord.gg/UmbU38vg2r\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1392449/description_8b603dbf-8b49-4e57-b9dd-5cd817c64a43.png\" width=\"350\" height=\"120\"></a></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Мод создан для модпака&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/alaskan-wilderness-reimagined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alaskan Wilderness Reimagined</a></em></p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/F2DYiLuTijw\" width=\"535\" height=\"300\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>БАШНЯ</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Мод добавляет уютные смотровые башни в лесах</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Не обязательно появляется в точке возрождения игрока или поблизости</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Используйте <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">/locate structure annoytower:tower</span>, чтобы легко найти её после создания мира :)</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1392449/description_7fb728eb-08b8-4753-9e74-fdd31f875af9.png\" width=\"503\" height=\"278\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1392449/description_12f0ef04-8d23-4932-94db-0adad6ab0c43.png\" width=\"506\" height=\"283\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1392449/description_b5ce37d4-c84a-4c13-8618-04fa9a5fa7ab.png\" width=\"506\" height=\"283\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>ЗАВИСИМОСТИ</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Башня содержит блоки из других модов</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Скачайте их тоже, если хотите получить полный игровой опыт, или хотя бы «некоторые из них»</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Я перечислил моды от наиболее важных к наименее важным</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/refurbished-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crayfish Furniture</a></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-chimneys\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Advanced Chimneys</a></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-mobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex Mobs</a></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/brewin-and-chewin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Brewin n Chewin</a></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-respite\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Respite</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1392449/description_fd42b7cd-0607-4738-9fb5-5b6310d82b5d.png\" width=\"517\" height=\"289\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
